abstract: "An auditable, computationally reproducible case study of specific recovery policies, concurrency behavior, and acknowledgment costs in single-replica Redis Streams 7.4.2 and NATS JetStream 2.10.24. Manuscript and research material use CC-BY-4.0; original software and formalization use MIT. See LICENSE.md for scope and third-party exceptions."
